{"1":{"w":[{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"When"},{"c":"السَّمَاءُ","d":"l-samāu","e":"the sky"},{"c":"انْفَطَرَتْ","d":"infaṭarat","e":"(is) cleft asunder"}],"a":{"g":"When the sky breaks apart"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"And when"},{"c":"الْكَوَاكِبُ","d":"l-kawākibu","e":"the stars"},{"c":"انْتَثَرَتْ","d":"intatharat","e":"scatter"}],"a":{"g":"And when the stars fall, scattering,"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"And when"},{"c":"الْبِحَارُ","d":"l-biḥāru","e":"the seas"},{"c":"فُجِّرَتْ","d":"fujjirat","e":"are made to gush forth"}],"a":{"g":"And when the seas are erupted"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"And when"},{"c":"الْقُبُورُ","d":"l-qubūru","e":"the graves"},{"c":"بُعْثِرَتْ","d":"buʿ'thirat","e":"are overturned"}],"a":{"g":"And when the [contents of] graves are scattered,"}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"عَلِمَتْ","d":"ʿalimat","e":"Will know"},{"c":"نَفْسٌ","d":"nafsun","e":"a soul"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"قَدَّمَتْ","d":"qaddamat","e":"it has sent forth"},{"c":"وَأَخَّرَتْ","d":"wa-akharat","e":"and left behind"}],"a":{"g":"A soul will [then] know what it has put forth and kept back."}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"يَاأَيُّهَا","d":"yāayyuhā","e":"O"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانُ","d":"l-insānu","e":"man!"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"What"},{"c":"غَرَّكَ","d":"gharraka","e":"has deceived you"},{"c":"بِرَبِّكَ","d":"birabbika","e":"concerning your Lord"},{"c":"الْكَرِيمِ","d":"l-karīmi","e":"the Most Noble"}],"a":{"g":"O mankind, what has deceived you concerning your Lord, the Generous,"}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"Who"},{"c":"خَلَقَكَ","d":"khalaqaka","e":"created you"},{"c":"فَسَوَّاكَ","d":"fasawwāka","e":"then fashioned you"},{"c":"فَعَدَلَكَ","d":"faʿadalaka","e":"then balanced you"}],"a":{"g":"Who created you, proportioned you, and balanced you?"}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"In"},{"c":"أَيِّ","d":"ayyi","e":"whatever"},{"c":"صُورَةٍ","d":"ṣūratin","e":"form"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"that"},{"c":"شَاءَ","d":"shāa","e":"He willed"},{"c":"رَكَّبَكَ","d":"rakkabaka","e":"He assembled you"}],"a":{"g":"In whatever form He willed has He assembled you."}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"كَلَّا","d":"kallā","e":"Nay!"},{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"But"},{"c":"تُكَذِّبُونَ","d":"tukadhibūna","e":"you deny"},{"c":"بِالدِّينِ","d":"bil-dīni","e":"the Judgment"}],"a":{"g":"No! But you deny the Recompense."}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّ","d":"wa-inna","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"عَلَيْكُمْ","d":"ʿalaykum","e":"over you"},{"c":"لَحَافِظِينَ","d":"laḥāfiẓīna","e":"(are) surely guardians"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, [appointed] over you are keepers,"}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"كِرَامًا","d":"kirāman","e":"Noble"},{"c":"كَاتِبِينَ","d":"kātibīna","e":"recording"}],"a":{"g":"Noble and recording;"}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"يَعْلَمُونَ","d":"yaʿlamūna","e":"They know"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"whatever"},{"c":"تَفْعَلُونَ","d":"tafʿalūna","e":"you do"}],"a":{"g":"They know whatever you do."}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الْأَبْرَارَ","d":"l-abrāra","e":"the righteous"},{"c":"لَفِي","d":"lafī","e":"(will be) surely in"},{"c":"نَعِيمٍ","d":"naʿīmin","e":"bliss"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, the righteous will be in pleasure,"}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّ","d":"wa-inna","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"الْفُجَّارَ","d":"l-fujāra","e":"the wicked"},{"c":"لَفِي","d":"lafī","e":"(will be) surely in"},{"c":"جَحِيمٍ","d":"jaḥīmin","e":"Hellfire"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, the wicked will be in Hellfire."}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"يَصْلَوْنَهَا","d":"yaṣlawnahā","e":"They will burn (in) it"},{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(on the) Day"},{"c":"الدِّينِ","d":"l-dīni","e":"(of) the Judgment"}],"a":{"g":"They will [enter to] burn therein on the Day of Recompense,"}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"they"},{"c":"عَنْهَا","d":"ʿanhā","e":"from it"},{"c":"بِغَائِبِينَ","d":"bighāibīna","e":"(will be) absent"}],"a":{"g":"And never therefrom will they be absent."}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And what"},{"c":"أَدْرَاكَ","d":"adrāka","e":"can make you know"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"يَوْمُ","d":"yawmu","e":"(is the) Day"},{"c":"الدِّينِ","d":"l-dīni","e":"(of) the Judgment"}],"a":{"g":"And what can make you know what is the Day of Recompense?"}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"أَدْرَاكَ","d":"adrāka","e":"can make you know"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"يَوْمُ","d":"yawmu","e":"(is the) Day"},{"c":"الدِّينِ","d":"l-dīni","e":"(of) the Judgment"}],"a":{"g":"Then, what can make you know what is the Day of Recompense?"}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"تَمْلِكُ","d":"tamliku","e":"will have power"},{"c":"نَفْسٌ","d":"nafsun","e":"a soul"},{"c":"لِنَفْسٍ","d":"linafsin","e":"for a soul"},{"c":"شَيْئًا","d":"shayan","e":"anything"},{"c":"وَالْأَمْرُ","d":"wal-amru","e":"and the Command"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"لِلَّهِ","d":"lillahi","e":"(will be) with Allah"}],"a":{"g":"It is the Day when a soul will not possess for another soul [power to do] a thing; and the command, that Day, is [entirely] with Allah."}}}